      "writtenOn": "2024-03-10T12:22:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think one of lorenzo\u0027s comment suggest remove mPollingStarted\n\nquote\n\n```\nThat way we can get rid of mPollingStarted, and just maintain the invariant that \"data usage polling and ND monitoring and conntrack monitoring are running iff at least one IpServer is serving\".\n```\n\nI also feel this field is redundant and used in a lot of other place which will make the logic hard to follow. Could you please double confirm if it is no harm to remove this field?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 528,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 528,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "df84033e08f683f4216dba93a9b479344e9b510e",
