      "writtenOn": "2024-06-03T12:11:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I removed ```mPollingStarted``` and removed \u0027maybe\u0027 from the name of all ```maybeXXX``` methods accordingly. ```schedulePollingStats``` and ```scheduleConntrackTimeoutUpdate``` are the only two methods that check on ```mPollingStarted``` value to determine whether to schedule the next timer. In ```stopStatsAndConntrackTimeoutPolling```, these two delayed messages should be removed from the Handler\u0027s queue and won\u0027t be executed. I think it is no harm to remove this variable.",
